  "notes": "Cash basis, governmental funds only (no business-type funds). Statement lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Taxes 5,727,104 split using the Statement of Activities general receipts Property/Motor vehicle/Lodging (p2), exact. Local 742,673 split using Statement of Activities charges for services 527,368 + interest income 67,688 + miscellaneous 147,617 (p2), exact. Debt service principal and interest 508,565 split from the Road Impr Bond Fund column (p6). Sale of assets 43,497 in other_financing. Beginning fund balance as originally stated 7,929,542 with prior period adjustment (656,186) as an adjustment. Fund balances in the fund_balance fields; ending_cash = TOTAL ASSETS (cash + restricted cash) on p3; no beginning cash printed. Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement (p3), whose totals equal the government-wide statement (p1). Detail: General Fund column from its budget schedule (p7, by department), Inheritance Tax Fund and Noxious Weed columns from the General Fund combining statement (p5; Veteran's Aid all zero), Road Fund (p8) and American Rescue Plan Fund (p9) budget schedules, and each non-major fund column from the combining statement (p6; Miscellaneous Sinking has no activity). Inheritance Tax Fund capital outlay has no printed function (plain Capital Outlay). Read pages 1-9 of 9"
